  <p><strong>Saddlebrook, Lexington Oaks, Quail Hollow, Country Walk:</strong> Older construction, often duct systems in unconditioned attics running at 140°F. We inspect and seal before recommending equipment replacement - saves thousands in unnecessary upsizing.</p>
